      *> The answer of the customer to a quote: approved or refused, when, by which channel, why, and who registered it. One row per answer, never changed.
       FD  APPROVAL-FILE
           RECORD CONTAINS 153 CHARACTERS.
           01 APPROVAL-RECORD.
               05 APR-ID PIC 9(8). *> Primary key
               05 APR-QUO-ID PIC 9(8).
               05 APR-REV PIC 9(2).
               05 APR-DECISION PIC X(1). *> A approved, R refused or asked for a change
               05 APR-CHANNEL PIC X(10). *> LINK, PHONE, WHATSAPP or COUNTER
               05 APR-AT PIC 9(14).
               05 APR-REASON PIC X(80).
               05 APR-OPERATOR PIC X(30).
